{"schema": "fa-tpl/1", "unit": {"grade": "七上", "code": "2-3", "name": "負分數、分數的四則運算、倒數、最簡分數", "curriculum": ["N-7-3 負數與數的四則混合運算（含分數）"]}, "note": "每個模板產一組平行題（A、B 卷同一組規則、不同數字）；distractors 是 src/units/七上2-3.js 的規則 id（迷思代碼沿用 題庫_七上2-3_分數的四則運算_路線A.json 的 FR01～FR12）。分數選項的比對鍵：值相同且約分狀態相同才算同一個（14/30 和 7/15 算不同）。v3.10（2026-11-10）新增。v3.71（2026-11-22）加 FR-dist、FR-ordmix、FR-min、FR-sub3（FR13～FR17）", "coverage": {"min": 10, "note": "每個迷思至少能產生 10 種不同題目（2026-11-10 老師裁定：比照七上 2-2）", "exclude": {}}, "tpls": [{"tpl": "FR-add", "title": "異分母分數相加", "kind": "frAdd", "bloom": "應用", "lc": "N-7-3", "seg": "七上2-3-S1", "params": {"sg": [1, -1], "p": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "q": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8, 9, 10, 12], "r": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7], "s": [2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 9, 10, 12]}, "let": {"F1": "sg < 0 ? '(−' + p + '/' + q + ')' : p + '/' + q"}, "when": "p < q && r < s && q != s && gcd(p, q) == 1 && gcd(r, s) == 1 && gcd(q, s) > 1 && sg * p * s + r * q != 0", "stem": "{F1}＋{r}/{s}＝？（寫成最簡分數）", "answer": "frT(sg * p * s + r * q, q * s)", "check": {"type": "fraction", "expr": "{F1}+{r}/{s}"}, "okfb": "正確！先通分（分母的最小公倍數 {lcm(q, s)}），加完再約分，得 {frT(sg * p * s + r * q, q * s)}。", "hint": "先通分（找分母的最小公倍數），加完再約分。", "distractors": ["FR07a", "FR07b", "FR10"], "pick": 3}, {"tpl": "FR-paren", "title": "減去括號（去括號變號）", "kind": "frParen", "bloom": "應用", "lc": "N-7-3", "seg": "七上2-3-S1", "params": {"a": [1, 2, 3, 5, 7, 11, 13], "c": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "d": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], "e": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], "f": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]}, "let": {"b": "lcm(d, f)"}, "when": "d > f && c > e && c < d && e < f && gcd(c, d) == 1 && gcd(e, f) == 1 && a < b && gcd(a, b) == 1 && -a - c * b / d + e * b / f != 0", "stem": "(−{a}/{b})−({c}/{d}−{e}/{f})＝？（寫成最簡分數）", "answer": "frT(-a - c * b / d + e * b / f, b)", "check": {"type": "fraction", "expr": "(−{a}/{b})−({c}/{d}−{e}/{f})"}, "okfb": "正確！去括號每一項都變號：−{a}/{b}−{c}/{d}＋{e}/{f}，通分成分母 {b}，再約分得 {frT(-a - c * b / d + e * b / f, b)}。", "hint": "先算括號（通分），或去括號時每一項都變號。", "distractors": ["FR01", "FR10", "FR07"], "pick": 3}, {"tpl": "FR-mixed", "title": "負帶分數的意義", "kind": "frMixed", "bloom": "理解", "lc": "N-7-3", "seg": "七上2-3-S1", "params": {"a": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "b": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7], "c": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9]}, "when": "b < c && gcd(b, c) == 1", "stem": "下列哪一個算式和 −{a}又{b}/{c} 相等？", "answer": "'−' + a + '−' + b + '/' + c", "check": {"type": "sameValue", "expr": "−{a}又{b}/{c}"}, "okfb": "正確！−{a}又{b}/{c}＝−({a}＋{b}/{c})＝−{a}−{b}/{c}，負號管整個帶分數。", "hint": "帶分數 {a}又{b}/{c}＝{a}＋{b}/{c}；前面的負號管整個帶分數。", "distractors": ["FR02a", "FR02b", "FR02c"], "pick": 3}, {"tpl": "FR-recip", "title": "互為倒數", "kind": "frRecip", "bloom": "理解", "lc": "N-7-3", "seg": "七上2-3-S2", "params": {"f": [0, 1, 2, 3], "s5": [1, -1], "a": [1, 2, 3], "b": [1, 2, 3, 4], "c": [2, 3, 4, 5, 7], "p": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7], "q": [2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 9], "a2": [1, 2, 3], "b2": [2, 3, 4], "c2": [3, 5, 7], "u": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "v": [2, 3, 4, 5, 7]}, "when": "b < c && gcd(b, c) == 1 && p != q && gcd(p, q) == 1 && b2 < c2 && gcd(b2, c2) == 1 && u != v && gcd(u, v) == 1", "stem": "下列哪一組數互為倒數？", "answer": "f == 0 ? '−' + a + '又' + b + '/' + c + ' 與 ' + frT(-c, a * c + b) : f == 1 ? '−' + p + '/' + q + ' 與 ' + frT(-q, p) : f == 2 ? a + '又' + b + '/' + c + ' 與 ' + frT(c, a * c + b) : p + '/' + q + ' 與 ' + frT(q, p)", "check": {"type": "pairRel", "rel": "reciprocal"}, "okfb": "正確！兩數相乘等於 1。{f == 0 || f == 2 ? '帶分數先化成假分數 ' + (f == 0 ? '−' : '') + (a * c + b) + '/' + c + '，倒數是 ' + frT(f == 0 ? -c : c, a * c + b) + '。' : f == 1 ? '負數的倒數還是負數。' : '把分子分母對調。'}", "hint": "互為倒數：兩數相乘等於 1。帶分數先化成假分數。", "distractors": ["FR06", "FR05", "FR11"], "pick": 3}, {"tpl": "FR-mixmul", "title": "帶分數乘以分數", "kind": "frMixMul", "bloom": "應用", "lc": "N-7-3", "seg": "七上2-3-S2", "params": {"a": [1, 2, 3], "b": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "c": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9], "p": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "q": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9]}, "when": "b < c && gcd(b, c) == 1 && p < q && gcd(p, q) == 1 && gcd((a * c + b) * p, c * q) > 1", "stem": "{a}又{b}/{c}×{p}/{q}＝？（寫成最簡分數）", "answer": "frT((a * c + b) * p, c * q)", "check": {"type": "fraction", "expr": "{a}又{b}/{c}×{p}/{q}"}, "okfb": "正確！先化成假分數 {a * c + b}/{c}，再乘 {p}/{q}，約分得 {frT((a * c + b) * p, c * q)}。", "hint": "帶分數先化成假分數再乘；乘完記得約分。", "distractors": ["FR08a", "FR08c", "FR10"], "pick": 3}, {"tpl": "FR-divsum", "title": "除以括號裡的和", "kind": "frDivSum", "bloom": "應用", "lc": "N-7-3", "seg": "七上2-3-S2", "params": {"a": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7], "b": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9], "c": [1, 2, 3], "d": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6], "e": [1, 2, 3], "f": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, "when": "a < b && gcd(a, b) == 1 && c < d && gcd(c, d) == 1 && e < f && gcd(e, f) == 1 && d != f && b * (c * f + e * d) / gcd(a * d * f, b * (c * f + e * d)) <= 60", "stem": "{a}/{b}÷({c}/{d}＋{e}/{f})＝？（寫成最簡分數）", "answer": "frT(a * d * f, b * (c * f + e * d))", "check": {"type": "fraction", "expr": "{a}/{b}÷({c}/{d}+{e}/{f})"}, "okfb": "正確！括號優先：{c}/{d}＋{e}/{f}＝{frT(c * f + e * d, d * f)}，{a}/{b}÷{frT(c * f + e * d, d * f)}＝{frT(a * d * f, b * (c * f + e * d))}。", "hint": "括號優先：先算 {c}/{d}＋{e}/{f}，再做除法。", "distractors": ["FR03", "FR07", "FR04", "FR10"], "pick": 3}, {"tpl": "FR-ord", "title": "乘除混合（由左到右）", "kind": "frOrd", "bloom": "應用", "lc": "N-7-3", "seg": "七上2-3-S2", "params": {"a": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7], "b": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9], "c": [2, 3, 4, 5, 7], "d": [3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9], "e": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "f": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9]}, "when": "a < b && gcd(a, b) == 1 && c < d && gcd(c, d) == 1 && e < f && gcd(e, f) == 1 && b * c * f <= 120 && b * d * f <= 200", "stem": "(−{a}/{b})÷{c}/{d}×{e}/{f}＝？（寫成最簡分數）", "answer": "frT(-a * d * e, b * c * f)", "check": {"type": "fraction", "expr": "(−{a}/{b})÷{c}/{d}×{e}/{f}"}, "okfb": "正確！由左到右，把「÷{c}/{d}」改成「×{d}/{c}」再一起乘：{frT(-a * d * e, b * c * f)}。", "hint": "由左而右；把「÷{c}/{d}」改成「×{d}/{c}」再一起乘。", "distractors": ["FR04", "FR12", "FR10"], "pick": 3}, {"tpl": "FR-true", "title": "分數的關係式（哪一個正確）", "kind": "frTrue", "bloom": "分析", "lc": "N-7-3", "seg": "七上2-3-S1", "params": {"o": [0, 1], "o2": [0, 1], "p1": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "q1": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], "p2": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "q2": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], "u1": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "v1": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], "u2": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "v2": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], "a": [1, 2, 3, 4], "b": [1, 2, 3], "c": [2, 3, 4, 5], "g": [1, 2, 3], "h": [2, 3, 4, 5, 7], "i": [1, 2, 3], "j": [2, 3, 4, 5, 7]}, "when": "p1 < q1 && p2 < q2 && gcd(p1, q1) == 1 && gcd(p2, q2) == 1 && q1 != q2 && p1 * q2 < p2 * q1 && u1 < v1 && u2 < v2 && gcd(u1, v1) == 1 && gcd(u2, v2) == 1 && v1 != v2 && u1 * v2 < u2 * v1 && b < c && gcd(b, c) == 1 && g < h && i < j && h != j && gcd(g, h) == 1 && gcd(i, j) == 1", "stem": "下列哪一個式子正確？", "answer": "o == 0 ? '−' + p1 + '/' + q1 + '＞−' + p2 + '/' + q2 : '−' + p2 + '/' + q2 + '＜−' + p1 + '/' + q1", "check": {"type": "trueStmt", "want": true}, "okfb": "正確！{p1}/{q1}＜{p2}/{q2}，負數的大小和絕對值相反，所以 −{p1}/{q1}＞−{p2}/{q2}。", "hint": "每個式子都檢查一次：負數比大小看數線位置；帶分數的負號管整個數。", "distractors": ["FR09", "FR02", "FR07"], "pick": 3}, {"tpl": "FR-dist", "title": "負數乘進括號（分配律）", "kind": "frDist", "bloom": "應用", "lc": "N-7-3", "seg": "七上2-3-S3", "params": {"sg": [-1], "mx": [0, 1], "wv": [1, 2], "p": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "q": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8, 9], "r": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], "s": [2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 9, 12], "k": [1, 2], "o": [1, -1], "lr": [0, 1]}, "let": {"W": "mx * wv", "L": "lcm(q, s)", "n": "L * k", "A1": "n / q * (W * q + p)", "A2": "n / s * r", "ANS": "-(A1 + o * A2)", "FT": "W > 0 ? W + '又' + p + '/' + q : p + '/' + q", "OPS": "o > 0 ? '＋' : '−'", "OPE": "o > 0 ? '+' : '−'", "ST": "lr == 0 ? '(−' + n + ')×(' + FT + OPS + r + '/' + s + ')' : '(' + FT + OPS + r + '/' + s + ')×(−' + n + ')'", "SE": "lr == 0 ? '(−' + n + ')×(' + FT + OPE + r + '/' + s + ')' : '(' + FT + OPE + r + '/' + s + ')×(−' + n + ')'"}, "when": "p < q && r < s && q != s && gcd(p, q) == 1 && gcd(r, s) == 1 && n <= 36 && ANS != 0 && (mx == 1 || o > 0 || (p > r && q > s))", "stem": "{ST}＝？", "answer": "ANS", "check": {"type": "fraction", "expr": "{SE}"}, "okfb": "正確！(−{n}) 要乘到括號裡每一項：(−{n})×{FT}＝{sgn(-A1)}，(−{n})×({o > 0 ? '' : '−'}{r}/{s})＝{sgn(-o * A2)}，合起來是 {sgn(ANS)}。", "hint": "括號外的數要乘到括號裡每一項，每一項都各用一次正負號規則；帶分數先化成假分數再乘。", "distractors": ["FR13", "FR17", "FR08", "FR07"], "pick": 3, "sameAB": ["sg", "mx", "o"]}, {"tpl": "FR-ordmix", "title": "加減與乘除混合（先乘除後加減）", "kind": "frOrdMix", "bloom": "應用", "lc": "N-7-3", "seg": "七上2-3-S3", "params": {"a": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], "b": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6], "o1": [1, -1], "c": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "d": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6], "o2": [0, 1], "e": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "f": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "ng": [1, -1]}, "let": {"Xn": "o2 == 0 ? c * e * ng : c * f * ng", "Xd": "o2 == 0 ? d * f : d * e", "N": "a * Xd + o1 * Xn * b", "D": "b * Xd", "CV": "f == 1 ? '' + e : e + '/' + f", "CT": "ng < 0 ? '(−' + CV + ')' : CV", "OP1": "o1 > 0 ? '＋' : '−'", "OP1E": "o1 > 0 ? '+' : '−'", "OP2": "o2 == 0 ? '×' : '÷'"}, "when": "a < b && gcd(a, b) == 1 && c < d && gcd(c, d) == 1 && gcd(e, f) == 1 && e != f && (f > 1 || e > 1) && N != 0 && D / gcd(abs(N) + (N == 0) * D, D) <= 48", "stem": "{a}/{b}{OP1}{c}/{d}{OP2}{CT}＝？（寫成最簡分數）", "answer": "frT(N, D)", "check": {"type": "fraction", "expr": "{a}/{b}{OP1E}{c}/{d}{OP2}{CT}"}, "okfb": "正確！先乘除後加減：{c}/{d}{OP2}{CT}＝{frT(Xn, Xd)}，再和 {a}/{b} 相{o1 > 0 ? '加' : '減'}，得 {frT(N, D)}。", "hint": "先乘除、後加減；除以一個數要乘它的倒數，倒數不變號。", "distractors": ["FR14", "FR12", "FR11", "FR07", "FR10"], "fallback": ["FR07", "FR10"], "pick": 3, "sameAB": ["o2", "ng"]}, {"tpl": "FR-min", "title": "比大小（分子分母都有負號、去括號）", "kind": "frMin", "bloom": "理解", "lc": "N-7-3", "seg": "七上2-3-S1", "params": {"u": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9], "v": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9], "p": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9], "q": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9], "x": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "y": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6], "z": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], "w": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6], "s": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "t": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9]}, "when": "gcd(u, v) == 1 && gcd(p, q) == 1 && p != q && p * v > u * q && gcd(x, y) == 1 && gcd(z, w) == 1 && x < y && y != w && z * y > x * w && (x * w + z * y) * v > u * y * w && gcd(s, t) == 1 && s * v < u * t", "stem": "下列哪一個數最小？", "answer": "'−' + u + '/' + v", "check": {"type": "extreme", "want": "min"}, "okfb": "正確！−{u}/{v} 是負數，而且比其他負數離原點遠。分子分母都是負數的分數是正數；有括號的先把每一項都變號再判斷正負。", "hint": "先判斷每個數是正還是負：同號相除為正、去括號每一項都要變號；負數離原點愈遠愈小。", "distractors": ["FR15", "FR01", "FR09"], "pick": 3}, {"tpl": "FR-sub3", "title": "三項加減（由左而右）", "kind": "frSub3", "bloom": "應用", "lc": "N-7-3", "seg": "七上2-3-S1", "params": {"sA": [1, -1], "w": [0, 1, 2], "a": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "b": [2, 3, 4, 6], "c": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "d": [2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 12], "o": [1, -1], "e": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "f": [2, 3, 4, 6, 12]}, "let": {"L": "lcm(b, d, f)", "N": "sA * (w * b + a) * L / b - c * L / d + o * e * L / f", "AT": "(sA < 0 ? '−' : '') + (w > 0 ? w + '又' : '') + a + '/' + b", "OPS": "o > 0 ? '＋' : '−'", "OPE": "o > 0 ? '+' : '−'"}, "when": "a < b && gcd(a, b) == 1 && c < d && gcd(c, d) == 1 && e < f && gcd(e, f) == 1 && b != d && d != f && b != f && L <= 24 && N != 0", "stem": "{AT}−{c}/{d}{OPS}{e}/{f}＝？（寫成最簡分數）", "answer": "frT(N, L)", "check": {"type": "fraction", "expr": "{AT}−{c}/{d}{OPE}{e}/{f}"}, "okfb": "正確！通分成分母 {L}，加減由左而右算，得 {frT(N, L)}。", "hint": "加減混合要由左而右；減號後面的兩項不能先合起來算（減法沒有結合律）。", "distractors": ["FR16", "FR07", "FR10", "FR02"], "fallback": ["FR07", "FR10", "FR02"], "pick": 3, "sameAB": ["sA", "o"]}]}
